    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_suite">Part of the Mutqan Suite</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_vision_title">The Suite\'s Vision</string>
    <string name="about_vision_body">“Mutqan” is a suite of apps that help you master knowledge by the method scholars used to secure what they memorized: break the material into its layers, verify it through mutual recall, and review it at spaced intervals. This app serves the memorization of the Prophetic hadith, both matn and sanad.</string>
    <string name="about_method_title">The Method</string>
    <string name="about_method_layers">• Layers of memorization: the matn first, then the sanad as a relationship between teacher and student rather than a recited list.</string>
    <string name="about_method_recall">• Active recall: retrieve from memory before you see the answer; it works better than re-reading.</string>
    <string name="about_method_decay">• Spaced repetition on two curves: forgetting is modelled separately for the matn and the sanad, the sanad fades faster, and a mistake on a single narrator weakens the whole sanad.</string>
    <string name="about_method_pivots">• Pivots and narrators: the isnad network and the list of most slippery narrators point your review at your weak spots.</string>
    <string name="about_method_privacy">• Your data is yours: everything works offline, and your backups are JSON files you hold yourself.</string>
    <string name="about_ok">OK</string>
